{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/5da349c38fd10c84c3446f9cf0c8a2ed.poster.avif?t=1755866768\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/5da349c38fd10c84c3446f9cf0c8a2ed.webm?t=1755866768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/5da349c38fd10c84c3446f9cf0c8a2ed.mp4?t=1755866768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of a highly trained special agent\u2026 who also happens to be a very good boy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced stealth-action platformer you\u2019ll combine stealth, barkour (dog-parkour), and gadgets to complete your missions. Use these tools to explore vast, stunning locations with numerous secrets to discover.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you sneak through shadows, enter all guns blazing or bounce off rooftops - <strong>BARKOUR</strong> gives you the freedom to play your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/a246a6e263d5e3d85f1e254b537fc4cb.poster.avif?t=1755866768\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/a246a6e263d5e3d85f1e254b537fc4cb.webm?t=1755866768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/a246a6e263d5e3d85f1e254b537fc4cb.mp4?t=1755866768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AGENT T.H.U.N.D.E.R.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just saving the day - you're doing it with style, snark, and a tail that won\u2019t stop wagging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Agent T.H.U.N.D.E.R. - the world\u2019s most agile canine secret agent. Smart(ish), loyal, and absolutely unstoppable when equipped with high-tech gadgets and a bone to pick with evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with his grumpy-but-helpful AI sidekick A.L.F.-RED, T.H.U.N.D.E.R. confidently tackles missions his way: stealthy and slick or loud and proud. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/ad933c2ecd3afbaefaad10d36e08b37c.poster.avif?t=1755866768\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/ad933c2ecd3afbaefaad10d36e08b37c.webm?t=1755866768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/ad933c2ecd3afbaefaad10d36e08b37c.mp4?t=1755866768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc15 Become the Bark Knight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend stealth, speed and barkour to outsmart villains and complete missions your way. Each offers multiple approaches, so you're free to improvise\u2026 or just cause chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf A Dog with Flow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, slide, bounce and bark your way through beautiful and diverse levels full of verticality, secrets and challenges. It\u2019s all about rhythm, agility, and that perfect landing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde8 Unleash the Gadgets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From smoke grenades to jetpacks, swap out gear on the fly and upgrade your loadout with tools that are as stylish as they are effective. Looking cool is part of the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Sniff Out Secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse, stunning environments - from high-tech laboratories to shady amusement parks. You\u2019ll find hidden paths, bonus challenges and Easter eggs around every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/23fe4516123bf699fa2b9eff2c78b7f8.poster.avif?t=1755866768\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/23fe4516123bf699fa2b9eff2c78b7f8.webm?t=1755866768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/23fe4516123bf699fa2b9eff2c78b7f8.mp4?t=1755866768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUMMARY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BARKOUR</strong> isn\u2019t just about saving the day - it\u2019s about doing it with flair, fun, and a sense of humour. Whether you\u2019re in it for the acrobatics, the action, or just some good old-fashioned canine chaos - T.H.U.N.D.E.R.\u2019s got your tail covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1920290?t=1755866768","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/767f66c81888804634aac7f7db916a340c89266b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755866768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/f7743a5054bdfbc8a