ght</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend stealth, speed and barkour to outsmart villains and complete missions your way. Each offers multiple approaches, so you're free to improvise\u2026 or just cause chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf A Dog with Flow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, slide, bounce and bark your way through beautiful and diverse levels full of verticality, secrets and challenges. It\u2019s all about rhythm, agility, and that perfect landing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde8 Unleash the Gadgets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From smoke grenades to jetpacks, swap out gear on the fly and upgrade your loadout with tools that are as stylish as they are effective. Looking cool is part of the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Sniff Out Secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse, stunning environments - from high-tech laboratories to shady amusement parks. You\u2019ll find hidden paths, bonus challenges and Easter eggs around every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/23fe4516123bf699fa2b9eff2c78b7f8.poster.avif?t=1755866768\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/23fe4516123bf699fa2b9eff2c78b7f8.webm?t=1755866768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/extras/23fe4516123bf699fa2b9eff2c78b7f8.mp4?t=1755866768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUMMARY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BARKOUR</strong> isn\u2019t just about saving the day - it\u2019s about doing it with flair, fun, and a sense of humour. Whether you\u2019re in it for the acrobatics, the action, or just some good old-fashioned canine chaos - T.H.U.N.D.E.R.\u2019s got your tail covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["VARSAV Game Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920290/ea8fe896b8bb9367b45f6413e3986f05c1a359f5/header.jpg?t=1755866768","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00ae2024 VARSAV GAME STUDIOS S.A., THE VARSAV GAME STUDIOS LOGO AND BARKOUR LOGO ARE TRADEMARKS OF VARSAV GAME STUDIOS S.A. THE NAMES, DESIGNS, AND LOGOS OF ALL PRODUCTS ARE PROPERTY OF THEIR RESPECTIVE OWNERS AND USED BY PERMISSION. ALL TRADEMARKS ARE PROPERTY OF THEIR RESPECTIVE OWNERS.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257186170,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186170/movie480.mp4?t=1755866766","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186170/movie_max.mp4?t=1755866766"},"name":"Gamescom Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257186170/bf6cb8eba603090b8eb4dffb891505c228c198f1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755866766","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186170/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755866766","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186170/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755866766"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257045365,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257045365/movie480.mp4?t=1755852718","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257045365/movie